  "flow_summary": "The interviewer was patient and persistent in guiding a confused patient through a long intake, but the interaction suffered from significant mechanical repetition and a failure to handle the safety disclosure appropriately. While the interviewer successfully navigated the patient's confusion, they frequently repeated questions verbatim when the patient struggled, and the safety response was both poorly timed and redundant.",
